      en: ["Founded on October 14, 1889, and named after the country of Armenia.", "Known as 'La Ciudad Milagro' (The Miracle City) for its rapid post-earthquake recovery.", "A key part of the UNESCO-designated Coffee Cultural Landscape of Colombia.", "Home to the Quimbaya Gold Museum, showcasing pre-Hispanic indigenous art."]
