      en: ["Founded on June 17, 1773, as Villa de las Palmas.", "Known as the 'Agricultural Capital of Colombia' for its fertile soil.", "Home to CIAT, one of the world's leading agricultural research centers.", "The city's international airport actually serves the nearby city of Cali."]
