      en: ["Founded as an indigenous settlement and established as a town in 1819.", "Known as the 'Pearl of Boyacá' (La Perla de Boyacá).", "Home to the Pueblito Boyacense, a beautiful architectural theme park.", "Major national hub for the heavy transport and automotive industry."]
